  "prefLabel": "Alc 312.06 Clinical Supervision Training Form",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 312.06 Clinical Supervision Training Form. The report form documenting hours of training in clinical supervision shall require:\n\n(a) The date of the training;\n\n(b) The title of the training;\n\n(c) A description of the training course and goals;\n\n(d) The sponsor and presenter of the training;\n\n(e) The number of contact hours included in the training;\n\n(f) From the list outlined in Alc 316.04(a), the topic area addressed by the training; and\n\n(g) Attached as extra sheets, copies of certificates and other supporting documentation verifying that such training has been completed.\n\nSource. #12001, eff 10-13-16; renumbered by #14584, eff 7-14-26 (formerly Alc 316.06)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
